title: a2 Stakeholders
syntax: xwiki/2.1
%%WIKI-SYNC-META%%
**Abstract.** Stakeholders: everyone affected by the situated activities, recorded through the values they hold and their relationships to one another. Our main concept is **Meaningful Connections** (social introductions). The morning care stakeholders are unrelated to social introductions and are documented separately below.

